  12: insensitive). When the same transaction id appears in multiple non-provisional
  13: ledger blocks, the last such block in file order is the base row for that id.
  14: 
  15: Locate section boundaries with regular expressions anchored to whole heading
  16: lines at line start. Do not locate sections with indexOf or substring search.
